# 4. High-level architecture

The final system should eventually follow this architecture:

```text
                         ┌─────────────────────┐
                         │     Web Browser      │
                         │ React + TypeScript   │
                         └──────────┬──────────┘
                                    │
                                    │ HTTPS
                                    ▼
                         ┌─────────────────────┐
                         │       NGINX         │
                         │ Reverse Proxy       │
                         └──────────┬──────────┘
                                    │
                                    ▼
                         ┌─────────────────────┐
                         │       FastAPI       │
                         │      Backend        │
                         └──────────┬──────────┘
                                    │
                     ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
                     │              │              │
                     ▼              ▼              ▼
                PostgreSQL       Redis          Celery
                Database         Cache        Background
                                               Processing
```

Later this will expand to:

```text
                    React Web
                       │
                       ▼
                    FastAPI
                       │
        ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
        ▼              ▼              ▼
   PostgreSQL        Redis          Celery
        │
        ▼
 Attendance Engine
        │
   ┌────┼─────────┐
   ▼    ▼         ▼
 GPS  Geofence  Selfie
   │    │         │
   └────┼─────────┘
        ▼
    Attendance
        │
 ┌──────┼────────────┐
 ▼      ▼            ▼
Leave  Payroll     Reports
```

